<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia's Merukh says delays Bre-X lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Indonesia's Merukh says delays Bre-X lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indonesian businessman Jusuf Merukh, who is claiming 40 percent of the Busang gold find in East Kalimantan, said on Wednesday he has delayed an intended $1.9 billion lawsuit against his partner Bre-X Minerals Ltd until December 4.</p>
<p>He also said that his claim on the find, majority-owned by Bre-X, has not been affected by talks between Bre-X and Barrick Gold Corp to form a joint venture to exploit Busang.</p>
</text>
